Interpretation:
  The boundary correction is not a uniform 1/7.  In the checked frontier
  and the exhaustive single-far scan, the exact worst ratio is 14/15,
  attained by a bounded base whose q6 interval is controlled by speed 14
  and a new far speed f=15.  The adjacent two-far frontier has worst
  ratio 7/8.  Both worst packet rows still have large positive gK8 margin.
